<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 3.385 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 3.385 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico plans to inject 3.385 billion pesos of liquidity into the secondary money market on Thursday via three credit auctions, traders said.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM</p>
<p>1.192 bln pesos  13 days</p>
<p>1.193 bln pesos  12 days</p>
<p>   1.000 bln pesos   1 day</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9562</p>
</text>
